          },
          "html": "Caresse"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": " › Is Caresse safe?\n    "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "🔒 · Privacy · Data · AI"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Is Caresse <em>safe</em>?"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "An intimate app that uses AI raises legitimate questions. Here's exactly what Caresse collects, what it doesn't, and how your data is protected."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download for free</a>\n            <a href=\"/legal/en/privacy/\" class=\"cta-ghost\">Read the full policy</a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Hosted in Europe · No data resale · Delete your account anytime"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "pillars"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Our approach"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Privacy as a design priority."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "This isn't a marketing line added afterward. These principles have shaped how Caresse was built from day one."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pillars-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pillar-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔒</div>\n                <h3>Private experiences</h3>\n                <p>Every generated session stays accessible only from your account. Nothing is published or shared between users.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pillar-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎭</div>\n                <h3>Anonymous identifier</h3>\n                <p>No email or phone number required. You use the app with an anonymous identifier and the first name of your choice.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pillar-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🇪🇺</div>\n                <h3>Hosted in Europe</h3>\n                <p>Your data and audio files are hosted on Microsoft Azure servers located in Europe, with encrypted HTTPS/TLS exchanges.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pillar-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🗑️</div>\n                <h3>Permanent deletion</h3>\n                <p>You can delete your account and all your data at any time. Deletion is irreversible and immediate.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "data"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Transparency"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "What Caresse collects, and why."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "The strict minimum needed for the service to work. Nothing more."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "data-table-wrap"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "table",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "data-table"
              },
              "html": "\n                <thead>\n                    <tr><th>Data</th><th>Why</th></tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr><td class=\"what\">Anonymous identifier</td><td class=\"why\">Authentication and persistence of your account, without email or phone.</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"what\">First name or alias</td><td class=\"why\">Spoken by the AI voice to personalize your experiences.</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"what\">Session settings</td><td class=\"why\">Practices, mood, duration, preferences: needed to generate your experience.</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"what\">Experience history</td><td class=\"why\">Access your past experiences from the app.</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"what\">Purchase data</td><td class=\"why\">Managing your credits and your unlimited access.</td></tr>\n                </tbody>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "data-not-collected"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "<strong>Caresse does not collect:</strong> email address (unless you contact us), phone number, GPS location, contacts, biometric data, or any information that could identify you outside the app."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "control"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "control-inner"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "control-text"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "section-label"
                  },
                  "html": "Under your control"
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "h2",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "section-title",
                    "style": "text-align:left;"
                  },
                  "html": "AI generates, you decide."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "section-sub"
                  },
                  "html": "Each experience is generated on demand from your choices. Session settings are sent in pseudonymized form to AI and text-to-speech providers. <strong><u>No</u></strong> data that could directly identify you is shared with these providers."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "ul",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "trust-list"
                  },
                  "html": "\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> No data resale to advertisers</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> No advertising cookies or tracking trackers</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> Right of access, rectification and erasure (GDPR)</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> Encrypted HTTPS/TLS communications</li>\n                "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {},
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "style": "background: var(--grad-soft); border-radius: 28px; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid rgba(158,123,181,0.12);"
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "html",
                      "file": "is-caresse-safe.en/0242"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "style": "font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;"
                      },
                      "html": "Caresse is an intimate app. Protecting your privacy isn't just a legal obligation, it's a core priority."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "style": "font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary);"
                      },
                      "html": "Excerpt from our <a href=\"/legal/en/privacy/\" style=\"color: var(--primary-vibrant); font-weight: 600;\">privacy policy</a>"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "adults"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Built for adults"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Consent at every step."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "adults-card"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Caresse is restricted to people aged 18 and over. Every session is configured by you, with natural reminders of consent and safe practices built into the experience."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "What you want to know"
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse record my voice?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. Caresse does not capture or record your voice. The voices you hear are generated through text-to-speech (TTS) from the scenario's text, not from a recording of you."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Are my experiences public or shared?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. Every generated experience is private and accessible only from your account. Nothing is published, shared between users, or made visible to third parties."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do I need an identifiable account to use Caresse?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. Caresse works with an anonymous identifier and a first name or alias of your choice. No email address or phone number is required to use the app or make a purchase."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What does Caresse do with my data when I generate an experience?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Session settings are sent in pseudonymized form to AI and text-to-speech providers to generate the audio. No data that could directly identify you is shared with these providers."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I delete my data permanently?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. You can request the complete deletion of your account at any time. This permanently erases your experiences, audio files and profile settings, in line with your right to erasure (GDPR)."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Where is my data hosted?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "On Microsoft Azure servers located in Europe, with encrypted HTTPS/TLS communications between the app and the servers."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse sell my data to advertisers?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. No personal data is sold to third parties for advertising or commercial purposes. Caresse does not use advertising cookies or tracking trackers."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse restricted to adults?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Caresse is restricted to people aged 18 and over, and relies on participants' consent at every step of configuring a session."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
